OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fgive way to an organised band of heavy
OL,7,Fshowers pushing in from the west
OL,8,Fovernight. These mostly push through
OL,9,Fquickly in the south, but linger
OL,10,Fthrough the night over northern hills.
OL,11,FWinds falling light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA dry day with sunny spells
OL,14,Ffor most. Rain associated with Storm
OL,15,FAusten pushes into the south later.
OL,16,FMostly light winds, turning gusty with
OL,17,Fthe storm in the far southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
